<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Z9X v6.1: static RRO on framework-res ("android"): res/xml/global_keys.xml (remote keys routed
     to our apps) and res/values/config.xml (power key: short press nothing (v6.5; was sleep), long press power menu
     with "restart" only).
     Install: /system/product/overlay/Z9xFrameworkKeysOverlay.apk (0644). Signed with the image's
     platform key by gsi/apps/build_apk.sh.
     /system/product/overlay has no config.xml, so static overlays on "android" are ordered by
     priority (OverlayConfig.sStaticOverlayComparator). Live v6.2 device (`cmd overlay list android`):
     com.android.tv.overlay.framework, android.auto_generated_rro_product__, then this one (2000)
     last = highest (no ATVOverlay on this image), so its xml/global_keys wins. It REPLACES TvFrameworkOverlay's
     file as a whole (see the comment in res/xml/global_keys.xml); the two config values replace
     the lower-priority overlays' values.
     v6.3: + res/layout/shutdown_dialog.xml (framework-res defines no <overlayable>, so a preinstalled
     overlay may replace it): the shutdown / restart screen TvSystemUI's ShutdownUi inflates
     (com.android.internal.R.layout.shutdown_dialog) shows the Z9X wordmark; the ids it looks up
     (progress = ProgressBar, text1 / text2 = TextView) are kept, hidden.
     v6.5: + config_shortPressOnPowerBehavior 0 (a system POWER short press while awake does
     nothing; see res/values/config.xml).
     Lumen OS 1.0 (versionCode 100): + config_customizedMaxCachedProcesses 16, config_defaultAssistant
     org.z9x.projector (Recents on long-press HOME; Katniss removed) and 8 HDMI-CEC default bools
     (see res/values/config.xml). Signed with the release platform key by the sign stage.
     Lumen OS 1.0.0 (versionCode 101): + config_dreamsDefaultComponent = the Lumen Home sky screensaver.
     Lumen OS 1.0.1 (versionCode 102): version only; build suffix e (versionCode still 102, versionName
     1.0.1): + config_maxUiWidth 3840 over TvFrameworkOverlay's 1920, which capped the 4K UI at
     1920x1080 in WindowManager (see res/values/config.xml).
     Lumen OS 1.0.2 (versionCode 103): version only.
     No code, no permissions, no sharedUserId. min/target SDK 34 come from build_apk.sh. -->
<manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    package="org.z9x.overlay.framework"
    android:versionCode="103"
    android:versionName="1.0.2">
    <overlay
        android:targetPackage="android"
        android:isStatic="true"
        android:priority="2000" />
    <application android:hasCode="false" />
</manifest>
